                },
                "content": "```mermaid\ngraph LR\n  A[\"TRANSACTION NODE\"] --> B[\"MESSAGE TRACKER\"]\n  B --> C[\"RELATIONS\"]\n  C --> D[\"ADMINISTRATION\"]\n  E[\"Save\\nAdd\\nRemove\"] -.-> F[\"Add\"]\n  F -.-> G[\"Remove\"]\n  H[\"Id\"] --> I[\"ON\"]\n  I --> J[\"Relation description\"]\n  J --> K[\"Source type\"]\n  K --> L[\"Connection type\"]\n```",
