        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2. You can create few types of relations: DIRECTORY to DIRECTORY, FTP to FTP, DIRECTORY to FTP or FTP to DIRECTORY."
