                },
                "content": "```mermaid\ngraph LR\n  A[\"TRANSACTION NODE\"] --> B[\"MESSAGE TRACKER\"]\n  B --> C[\"RELATIONS\"]\n  C --> D[\"ADMINISTRATION\"]\n  E[\"Save\"] --> F[\"Add\"]\n  G[\"Remove\"] --> H[\"Remove\"]\n  I[\"ID\"] --> J[\"ON\"]\n  K[\"Relation description\"] --> L[\"Source type\"]\n  M[\"Connection type\"] --> N[\"Relation description orders\"]\n  O[\"Relation with FTP\"] --> P[\"to DIRECTORY\"]\n  Q[\"Add\"] --> R[\"Add\"]\n```",
